   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48C5

   1 a 0000 E48C5:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2c] THE ORIENTATION, flat: `b = ('EOF' = name)'.  [C191] pins literal-
   4 a 0006 on-the-left as a DIFFERENT helper with a DIFFERENT length register
   5 a 0006 (?SCCVM, MVI B,len).  P5 predicts the store route follows the
   6 a 0006 E29C9 TEST-route shape: LXI H,var / LXI D,lit / MVI B,n / ?SCCVM,
   7 a 0006 then the [C095] flag trick and STA. */
   8 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
   9 c 0006   dcl name char(30) varying;
  10 c 0006   name = 'AB';
  11 c 0013   b = ('EOF' = name);
  12 c 0024   put list('B=', b);
  13 c 0046   stop;
  14 a 0049 end E48C5;

CODE SIZE = 0049
DATA AREA = 0027
FREE SYMS = 3884
END  COMPILATION
